[[31,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Lower the steering wheel and\nmove it back to the end of travel position.</p><p><a href=\"#/3025799\">7040A26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025611\">5580C18</a></p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/769.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000041.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Follow the safety instructions\nfor this operation.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><p><a href=\"#/3025282\">4110A11</a></p><p>1. Unscrew the bolts</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2005043.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,63,0,"<p>1. Move the instrument panel slightly and disconnect the electrical\nconnections (1a, 1b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1a</p></td><td><p>Instrument panel</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3024051\">E50A</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Instrument panel</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3024052\">E50B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Recover the control panel.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2005044.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the instrument panel\nis not damaged.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection</p><p>Refit the instrument panel and fix it using\nthe bolt.</p><p><a href=\"#/3025282\">4110A11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025611\">5580C18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025799\">7040A26</a></p><p>Check the operation of the instrument and\nthe functions controlled by it.</p>"]]